# sanyuan-obsidian Python sidecar

Zero-runtime-dependency Python package for SQLite FTS5 retrieval, optional
OpenAI-compatible embeddings, transparent reranking, transient Sanyuan read
projection, and a loopback REST API.

See the parent integration README and `sanyuan-obsidian --help`.
